{"seq":9,"slug":"sensors-actuators","title":"传感器与执行器","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 传感器与执行器\n\n任何能与物理世界互动的系统，都要回答两个对偶的问题：怎样把「热的多少、压的多少、动的多少、亮的多少」读进电路，又怎样让电路反过来「转动、推动、形变」去改变世界。前者是传感，后者是执行。这本 hub 把感知与行动之间那条完整的信息链——从物理量到电信号、到数字、到判断、再到机械动作——拆成四章，讲成一个连贯闭环，而不是器件型号的罗列。\n\n第一章「传感原理」回答「世界如何变成电信号」。先用一套统一的指标语言（灵敏度、精度、分辨率、时间常数、带宽）给任意传感器画像，再落到温度、压力、惯性、磁场等物理量的具体机理，最后单列自成体系的光电与成像传感。这套指标语言会贯穿后面每一章——选型、误差预算、融合都建立在它之上。\n\n第二章「信号处理与接口」回答「微弱信号如何变成干净的数字并送出」。传感器原始输出往往只有微伏毫伏、阻抗高、混着干扰，先经信号调理放大滤波隔离，再由 ADC 在采样定理与量化精度的约束下数字化，最后经 I2C/SPI/I3C/CAN 等接口总线送进处理器。这一章是连接前两端的信号桥梁。\n\n第三章「执行器」回答「电信号如何变回机械动作」。从覆盖功率最广的电机与现代矢量控制，到填补精密与开关空白的电磁、压电执行器，再到力密度无可替代的液压与气动，三类执行技术按精度、力、行程、环境各占其位，共享「传感反馈—调理—闭环控制」的同一套思路。\n\n第四章「系统与应用」把前三章拼成系统。传感器融合让多个不完美的测量逼近真值，MEMS 与微系统赋予传感执行半导体级的成本曲线，物联网与智能传感则把「感知—传输—计算—执行」的闭环规模化到亿万节点、并把算力下沉到传感器旁。\n\n四章层层递进：感知给输入，接口搭桥，执行给输出，系统合成闭环。读完你将拥有的不是孤立的传感器与电机知识，而是一张能从一片硅上的微结构一路想到一座联网智能设备的完整图景。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sensing","title":"传感原理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sensor-classification","title":"传感器分类与特性","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/sensor-classification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"physical-quantity-sensing","title":"物理量传感","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/physical-quantity-sensing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"photo-imaging-sensing","title":"光电与成像传感","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/sensing/photo-imaging-sensing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"interface","title":"信号处理与接口","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"signal-conditioning","title":"信号调理电路","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface/signal-conditioning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adc-sampling","title":"ADC 与采样","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface/adc-sampling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sensor-interfaces-buses","title":"传感器接口与总线","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/interface/sensor-interfaces-buses"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"actuators","title":"执行器","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/actuators","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"motors-drives","title":"电机与驱动","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/actuators/motors-drives"},{"seq":2,"slug":"electromagnetic-piezo","title":"电磁与压电执行器","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/actuators/electromagnetic-piezo"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hydraulic-pneumatic","title":"液压与气动","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/actuators/hydraulic-pneumatic"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"systems","title":"系统与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sensor-fusion","title":"传感器融合","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/systems/sensor-fusion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mems-microsystems","title":"MEMS 与微系统","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/systems/mems-microsystems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"iot-smart-sensing","title":"物联网与智能传感","url":"/h/hardware-electronics/sensors-actuators/systems/iot-smart-sensing"}]}]}